; The Native4D graphs the C, Wasm and JavaScript bundle suites all run, so the
; three backends are held to the same cases: every dialect operation
; (Fixtures4.per_op) plus the multi-node graphs Native lowers into the dialect,
; which carry the Region-authored operations (an Lstm group, an Sdpa whose mask
; is omitted so a synthetic default is bound, norms, softmax) the per-op sweep
; cannot. No execution here; each backend's suite supplies its own.

(library
 (name loop_native4d_common)
 (libraries
  core
  err_trace
  fmt
  loop_ir
  loop_native4d
  native
  native4d
  native4d_test))
